'''Skuerto''' is a [[dwarf]] [[quest giver]] located in [[Refuge Pointe]] in the [[Arathi Highlands]]. He and [[Apprentice Kryten]] were sent to the [[Arathi Highlands]] by [[Archmage Malin]] to gather some reagents as well as to recover some artifacts that once belonged to Malin's master [[Archmage Trelane]]. He is very sensitive about criticisms to his skills at scouting.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|36|Worth Its Weight in Gold}}</ref>

